@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+The root writer reuses existing CP objects/tree/root summary and adds one
+qualified-writer bit for v4 provenance. The bit is separate from the old generic
+root summary: old child/expression writer behavior must keep its existing policy.
+RootControlPointPosition models external frame updates, local overrides, root
+position propagation, orientation/previous preservation and that new bit. Caller:
+literal SetSingleControlPointPosition on a root with CP transform or explicit
+PT_TYPE_INVALID identity. Unknown fallback-to-identity remains unqualified.
+Child writers retain external-input collision rejection and local propagation.
+No point cloning, separate pending transaction, cache, retry or new clock is added.
+Stateless finite/type/numerical predicates need compiled code checks. Scalar warp
+is immutable parameters/math using existing providers and introduces no lifecycle.
+Native collection timing, emission batching, rig acquisition and full effects are
+not established by these models/operators. Material parser remains unmodified.
